"""kx time-series experiment $EXP_ID — walk-forward validation (a Kaggle script kernel).

Validation windows move forward in time; each fold trains only on rows before its
window (an expanding window), so the CV never sees the future. Test predictions
come from one model refit on all training history.

Edit ONLY the AI BLOCK. The KX HARNESS is hashed at `kx new`; `kx run` refuses a
modified harness. Exceptions are never caught.
"""
